#12920
Atop a Mighty Rock, Enflamed~
   You reflexively shield your eyes from the bright flames that roar upward
from the edges of the great rock you find yourself standing upon. A well-worn
path leads from the craggy peak to the edge of the rock, to a small gap in the
flame.
~
cei 0 v 12920
D9
~
0 12921
E
flames wall fire~
   The entire rock upon which you stand is ringed by tall flames that roar as
they race toward the sky. Smoke clouds above the flames block any view of the
sky.
~
E
rock~
   You stand firmly on a rather large rock, engulfed in flames. At its edges,
the rock is red-hot and shooting flames high into the sky. But here, nearer the
center, it's surprisingly mild.
~
E
path~
   A worn footpath stretches from the peak, where you arrived, to the edge of
the rock.
~
E
peak~
The rock rises to the small peak where you arrived.
~
E
gap down crater earth down ground~
   Through a gap in the flames, you can see this enormous rock is plummeting
toward a crater in the earth below!
~
E
out north east south west northeast northwest southeast southwest~
   A wall of flame surrounds the rock, roaring upward. Through it, you can just
make out the ground below... and it's coming up fast!
~
E
stars starry sky night~
You can't see the sky through the smoky cloud above you.
~
E
clouds smoke smoky up~
   A cloud of smoke billows up from the top of the flame, blocking all view of
the sky.
~
E
moon crescent~
The crescent moon hangs low in the sky.
~
E
moons half-moons halfmoons~
   As you look down over the edge of the rock, you see faint, broken moons
hanging low in the sky near the crater.
~
