#12921
Terminus Forge~
   Streaks of light tear across the sky above your head as you stand in a deep
crater. At the bottom, a black, craggy rock rests in the center of the crater,
flattened on top so it can be used as a platform. On three sides, metal
archways made from the same rough metal crackle and spark, and briefly open
like magical portals when you approach.
Commands: challenge
~
cei 0 0 12920
D3
~
0 12922
D1
~
0 12923
D2
~
0 12924
D0
~
0 12925
