E
stump tree wood petrified stone~
   Amir has a hefty tree stump which has, by some means or another, turned
completely to stone. Cracks in the stump seem to be healing themselves, slowly
vanishing from the surface.
~
E
hammer~
Amir carries a rather large hammer made from a blue-black metal.
~
E
streaks sky up meteors lights~
   Meteors streak through the sky, mostly as thin streaks of light, except
three that burn brightly, trailing smoke through the night sky... and one of
them appears to be heading straight toward the crater!
~
E
stars starry expanse night~
   The endless night sky stretches out above you, streaked every few moments
by a shooting star. It would be tranquil if not for three large, blazing
meteors that dot the sky, each trailing smoke through the air.
~
E
smoke fire fiery~
Long, smoky tails follow behind three fiery meteors that dot the sky.
~
E
down bottom~
   A black, craggy rock rests in the center of the crater. A small tunnel cuts
beneath it, though you can't see what's down there from here.
~
E
rock meteorite~
   The rock is dark in color and heavily pocked, but it has a smooth, almost
polished finish. The flattened surface of the rock makes up the floor of the
crater, though certainly the rock is larger and partially buried.
~
E
craggy~
The rock has a craggy, pock-marked surface.
~
E
archways portals~
   On three sides of you -- east, west, and south -- craggy stone archways
mark the edges of the platform. They begin to glow like portals if you approach
them, and you can see through to another place inside.
~
E
platform~
   The flat top of the rock forms a large platform. Archways mark the east,
west, and south edges of the platform.
~
E
north~
The platform continues north, where Tane is stacking supplies.
~
E
out around~
All you can see from here is the rim of the crater. Above that, only sky.
~
E
moon~
   You can't see the moon from here. Although, there are a pair of broken moons
that seem to rest on the crater's rim.
~
E
moons half-moons halfmoons cracked broken~
   A pair of cracked and broken moons hang low in the sky, almost resting on
the crater's rim.
~
E
crater~
You're standing in a deep crater.
~
E
rim lip~
   The rim of the crater blocks much of the horizon. Strangely, a pair of
broken half-moons seem to rest on the crater's lip.
~
