#12922
Terminus Forge~
   A roaring wall of fire surrounds the rock on this side of the archway. The
crater is gone now; this rock is falling through the sky! The edges of this
rock are red-hot, but the center is surprisingly cool. Poles near the edge hold
pieces of metal in the roaring flame.
Commands: forge, smelt, shatter <item to destroy>
~
cei 0 hv 12920
D1
~
0 12921
E
fire flame fiery wall roaring~
   The entire rock is surrounded by a blazing wall of fire, which streaks
upward with incredible energy. Above it, a dark, smoky cloud blocks all view of
the sky. Several poles hold pieces of red-hot metal in the flame.
~
E
out down ground earth north south west northeast nw northwest nw southeast se southwest sw~
   Beyond the wall of fire, you can barely make out the night-blanketed world
below. It looks like the rock is falling fast through the sky!
   You can see glowing craters on the ground, as well as two cracked and broken
moons that have fallen from the sky.
~
E
rock center around~
   The dark, metallic rock is large enough for you, Hana, and her anvil, and
not a lot else.
~
E
edges red-hot redhot hot~
   At its edges, the rock is red-hot, almost to the point of melting it in the
powerful fire that roars all around. Poles hold pieces of Hana's metal in the
flames, turning them red-hot as well.
~
E
poles pieces metal~
Poles heat pieces of metal in the powerful flames around the rock.
~
E
sky~
You can't see the sky through the thick smoke.
~
E
stars starry expanse~
You can't see the stars through the thick smoke.
~
E
smoke smoky clouds up~
The dark, smoky cloud from the fire wall blocks all view of the sky above you.
~
E
night~
It's night out.
~
E
moon crescent~
   Beyond the flames, you can see the crescent moon low in the sky. Strangely,
you can also see a pair of cracked and broken moons down below.
~
E
moons half-moons halfmoons cracked broken~
   Far below this burning rock, you see a pair of moons that have fallen from
the sky. One is broken in half, and missing much of its glory. The other is
merely cracked like a spiderweb and devoid of its luster.
~
E
archway~
   The archway is made from a craggy metal rather similar to the rock you find
yourself upon. Through it, you can still see the crater you came from, rather
similar to a portal.
~
E
anvil~
   Hana is working at a heavy anvil that seems to be formed from the metallic
rock beneath, with its surface polished to a perfect plane.
~
