#12924
Terminus Forge~
   This side of the archway is serene. But for the tapping at the anvil, little
sound disrupts the clear view of the stars. You find yourself upon a great rock
or peak, but with no view of the world below. All around you, there are only
stars and the immenseness of the night sky. The only other objects in the sky
are the crescent moon and a large, glowing disc of blue.
Commands: forge, shatter <item to destroy>
~
cei 0 h 12924
D0
~
