#12927
A Battlefield in Freefall, at Sunset~
   You're plummeting through the air! There's little time to admire the radiant
sky; the ground is coming up fast. Yet somehow, at this speed, the rushing air
eneath you almost feels like a solid platform, and you've found your footing.
Commands: return
~
ci 0 0 12927
E
air~
   You're falling through the air! The ground is far below you, but less so
with each passing instant.
~
E
ground down~
Looking down isn't the best idea right now.
~
E
sky up around out~
   You're falling through the pink-gold sky of sunset, supported by nothing but
the rushing wind from below.
~
E
sunset radant radiance~
   On one side, the last rays of golden sun peek from the very edge of the
horizon, lighting distant clouds in fiery orange. On the other side, a rosy
band of stunning pink separates the turqouise blue of day above from the deep
and infinite blue of night below.
~
E
rosy pink band~
   A band of rosy pink light marks the transition between day and night in the
east.
~
E
twilight~
   Twilight has just begun to settle on the land as the sun sets to the west
and night rises in the east.
~
E
stars~
The first stars have begun to pierce twilight's veil.
~
E
platform footing~
   The wind beneath you rushes up so fast that it almost feels as though you're
standing on it.
~
E
north south east west northeast nw northwest nw southeast se southwest sw~
   In all directions, the horizon appears further than you've ever seen it...
as you plummet fast through the air!
~
